  "description": "OCIQUQ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C92 H105 Er5 N8 O32,5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er5 (Er) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.545-3.866 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.16-114.54°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Er5(LH)4(acac)4(μ3-O)(μ3-OH)(H2O)2]·5H2O (C92H115Er5N8O37). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
